  "details": "1. Setup Multi-cam streaming with streaming video player using Dollys\n\n2. Set up to 4 paths and select the \"Multi\" option (I used all four paths)\n\n3. Enable Spout\n\n4. Capture all spout streams in OBS\n\n5. Press play to start Path animation, and spout routing to OBS\n\n6. One or more paths will follow the player location/head position (I've had different variations of this)\n\nI've included a video recording of this to help explain! You can see the dolly icons moving when I move around, even though they're set to a path and do not have the \"follow player\" enabled. \n\nThanks",
